    "title": "Montrose Police respond to incident; Suspect in custody - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MONTROSE, Colo. ( KREX ) — At approximately 6:30 p.m. on Wednesday, the Montrose Police Department and Montrose County Sheriff’s Office teams responded to an incident at 801 North 1st Street in Montrose. Upon arrival, the scene was quickly made safe and a suspect was placed in custody. An individual at the scene received medical attention. There is no ongoing threat to the community. There is no additional information as officials are investigating the incident. The Montrose Police Department thanked first responders from their department, the Montrose County Sheriff’s Office, Montrose Fire Protection District and WestCO Communications “for keeping our community safe.” WesternSlopeNow will update this story as it develops. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WesternSlopeNow.com.",
